# Title: File Download Via Nscurl - MacOS
# ID: 6d8a7cf1-8085-423b-b87d-7e880faabbdf
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Daniel Cortez
# Date: 2024-06-04
# Tags: attack.command-and-control, attack.t1105
# Description: Detects the execution of the nscurl utility in order to download files.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(Image="*/nscurl" AND (CommandLine CONTAINS "--download " OR CommandLine CONTAINS "--download-directory " OR CommandLine CONTAINS "--output " OR CommandLine CONTAINS "-dir " OR CommandLine CONTAINS "-dl " OR CommandLine CONTAINS "-ld" OR CommandLine CONTAINS "-o "))
